---
description: Auto-load native macOS UI, Liquid Glass, and XcodeBuildMCP on every Echo change.
globs: "**/*.{swift,metal}"
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow these skills before writing or changing UI:

- `.cursor/skills/macos-native-ui/SKILL.md`
- `.cursor/skills/liquid-glass/SKILL.md`
- `.cursor/skills/xcodebuildmcp/SKILL.md`

Never recreate system controls. Never use the Xcode GUI.

Build: xcodebuild -scheme echo -destination 'platform=macOS'
Prefer XcodeBuildMCP tools.

After any UI change: build → run → screenshot. If it looks like a web card, rewrite with Button / Toggle / TabView.
